00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:34.570
So if you're reading some code--

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.840
so here, I want to
take the code here.

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:41.290
And I'm going to take the
data from cars data set.

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:45.970
And then, I'm going to mutate
